{
  "$comment": "Cases of buildos extract bulk (W1 R7 P9 t1), generated by generate-bulk-extract.ts. Each case copies bases/<base>/ into a fresh project folder, lays overlays/<overlay>/ over it and removes its remove paths, then runs its steps in order: run (the subcommand and its arguments, with stdin from files/<name>), write (a file from files/ into the project), or remove.",
